{"ID":"20230925155013-5honmju","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925155013-5honmju","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925155013-5honmju\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925155018-47duxxk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925155018-fsa9y0r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925155018-fsa9y0r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【防己茯苓汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925155018"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925155018-47duxxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925155018-47duxxk","updated":"20230925155018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：防己三两、黄芪三两、桂枝三两、茯苓六两、甘草二两（炙）"}]},{"ID":"20230925155018-61pxgdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925155018-61pxgdt","updated":"20230925155018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右五味，以水六升，煮取三升，分温三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925155018-w5rd0x8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925155018-w5rd0x8","updated":"20230925155018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【14-63】皮水，四肢肿，水气在皮肤中，四肢聂聂动者，防己茯苓汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925155018-fsa9y0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925155018-fsa9y0r"}}]}